"Embaixo discútese cada elemento do menú. Cando existe un atallo de teclado "
"que realice a función do elemento do menú, o atallo por omisión aparece "
"listado xunto co elemento do menú."

#. Tag: title
#: menus.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main Window"
msgstr "A fiestra principal"

#. Tag: title
#: menus.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "O menú <guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Window</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nova Fiestra</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:52 menus.docbook:1479
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creates a new main window."
msgstr "Crea unha nova xanela principal."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Abrir...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows you to open files which contain email messages."
msgstr "Permite abrir ficheiros que conteñen mensaxes de correo."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Gravar Como...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Saves the currently displayed message to a text file, including all the "
"headers and attachments."
msgstr ""
"Grava a mensaxe que se apresenta nese momento nun ficheiro de texto, "
"incluídas todas as cabeceiras e ficheiros anexos."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Import Messages...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Importar Mensaxes...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starts up <application>kmailcvt</application> (which is part of kdepim). "
"This application lets you import messages from several email clients &kmail;."
msgstr ""
"Inicia o <application>kmailcvt</application> (que é parte do kdepim). Esta "
"aplicación permite importar mensaxes desde varios clientes de correo para o "
"&kmail;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Imprimir...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display a dialog that lets you prints the currently displayed message."
msgstr ""
"Mostra un diálogo que permite imprimir a mensaxe que se presenta nese "
"momento."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Expire All Folders</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Caducar Todos os Cartafoles</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Delete old messages from all folders, according to the rules in each "
"folder's <link linkend=\"folders-properties-window\">Properties dialog</"
"link> (the default is not to delete old messages at all)."
msgstr ""
"Elimina todas as mensaxes de todos os cartafoles seguindo as regras do <link "
"linkend=\"folders-properties-window\">diálogo de propiedades</link> de cada "
"cartafol (por omisión non se apagan as mensaxes vellas)."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Refresh Local &imap; Cache</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Anovar a Caché &imap; Local</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will remove all changes that you have done locally to your IMAP folders "
"and redownload everything from the server. Use this if the local cache was "
"corrupted."
msgstr ""
"Desfanse todas as alteracións que vostede teña feito localmente nos seus "
"cartafoles de IMAP e transferirá de novo todo desde o servidor. Empregue "
"isto se se corrompeu a \"caché\" local."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Empty All Trash Folders</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Baleirar Todos os Cartafoles do "
"Lixo</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this to empty all trash folders, &ie; the local trash folder and all "
"trash folders that you might have on &imap; servers."
msgstr ""
"Empregue isto para baleirar todos os cartafoles do lixo, &ie; o cartafol "
"local do lixo e todos os cartafoles de lixo que poida ter nos servidores de "
"&imap;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Check Mail</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Comprobar Correo</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Checks for new messages in all your accounts, except those that have "
"<guilabel>Exclude from &quot;Check Mail&quot;</guilabel> enabled."
msgstr ""
"Procura as mensaxes novas de todas as contas, excepto daquelas que teñan "
"marcado <guilabel>Excluir de &quot;Comprobar Correo&quot;</guilabel>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Check Mail In</guisubmenu>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Comprobar Correo En</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "Submenu that lets you check for new messages from a particular account."
msgstr ""
"Sub-menú que permite procurar por mensaxes nuvas nunha conta determinada."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Send Queued Messages</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Enviar Mensaxes en Agarde</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sends the messages that are in your outbox."
msgstr "Envía as mensaxes que haxa na caixa de saída."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Sair</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Closes the current main window or exits &kmail; if there is only this one "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Fecha a xanela principal actual ou sae do &kmail; se só existe esa xanela."

