"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>J</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Mensaxe</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Aplicar Filtros</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1144
#, no-c-format
msgid "Applies your filters to the selected messages."
msgstr "Aplica os filtros ás mensaxes seleccionadas."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1150
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Message</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Apply Filter</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Mensaxe</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Aplicar Filtro</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to apply an individual filter to the selected messages. Only "
"filters for which you enabled the <guilabel>Add this filter to the Apply "
"Filter menu</guilabel> option will be available."
msgstr ""
"Permite aplicar un filtro individual ás mensaxes seleccionadas. Só é posíbel "
"utilizar isto cos filtros para os que se activou <guilabel>Engadir este "
"filtro ao menú Aplicar Filtros</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: menus.docbook:1168 menus.docbook:2061
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "O menú <guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>S</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Find Messages...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>S</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Procurar Mensaxes...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens up a search window that lets you search for messages with certain "
"characteristics, &eg; a certain subject. Start the search by entering some "
"values and press <guibutton>Search</guibutton>. Click on one of the "
"resulting messages and it will appear in the <guilabel>Message pane</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Abre unha xanela de pesquisa que permite procurar mensaxes con determinadas "
"características, &eg; un asunto concreto. Inicie a procura introducindo "
"algúns valores e prema <guibutton>Procurar</guibutton>. Calque nunha das "
"mensaxes resultantes e aparecerán na <guilabel>área de Mensaxes</guilabel>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1191
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Address Book</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Caderno de Enderezos</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starts up <ulink url=\"/kaddressbook/\">&kaddressbook;</ulink>, the &kde; "
"address book."
msgstr ""
"Inicia o <ulink url=\"/kaddressbook/\">&kaddressbook;</ulink>, o caderno de "
"enderezos do &kde;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Certificate Manager...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Xestor de Certificados...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starts <ulink url=\"/kleopatra\"><application>Kleopatra</application></"
"ulink>, the &kde; certificate manager."
msgstr ""
"Inicia o <ulink url=\"/kleopatra\"><application>Kleopatra</application></"
"ulink>, o xestor de certificados do &kde;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1220
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>GnuPG Log Viewer</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Visor de Rexistros de GnuPG</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starts <ulink url=\"/kwatchgnupg\"><application>KWatchGnuPG</application></"
"ulink>, a tool to present the debug output of <application>GnuPG</"
"application> application. If signing, encryption, or verification "
"mysteriously stop working, you might find out why by looking at the log."
msgstr ""
"Inicia o <ulink url=\"/kwatchgnupg\"><application>KWatchGnuPG</application></"
"ulink>, unha ferramenta que presenta a saída de depuración da aplicación "
"<application>GnuPG</application>. Se a sinatura, cifrado ou verificación "
"deixan de funcionar misteriosamente, pode averiguar a razón se olla para o "
"rexistro."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Edit \"Out of Office\" Replies...</"
"guisubmenu>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Editar as Respostas \"En Ausencia"
"\"...</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Launch the <guilabel>Configure \"Out of Office\" Replies</guilabel> dialog, "
"which allow you to set-up vacation notifications."
msgstr ""
"Lanza o diálogo <guilabel>Configurar as Respostas \"En Ausencia\"</"
"guilabel>, que permite configurar as notificacións das vacacións."

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Out of Office reply</guilabel> functionality relies on server-side "
"filtering. To be able to use it you need to configure the <link linkend="
"\"receiving-mail\">Filtering tab</link> (see option relevant to kolab "
"server) of your <guilabel>IMAP</guilabel> account set-up."
msgstr ""
"A funcionalidade <guilabel>respostas en ausencia</guilabel> depende do "
"filtrado do lado do servidor. Para podela utilizar terá que configurar a "
"<link linkend=\"receiving-mail\">pestana de filtrado</link> (vexa a opción "
"relacionada co servidor de Kolab) da configuración da conta de "
"<guilabel>IMAP</guilabel>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1255
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Filter Log Viewer...</guisubmenu>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Visor do Rexistro de Filtrado...</"
"guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens up the viewer window for the filter log; there you find some options "
"to control the logging of the filtering process. In the log you will find "
"valuable information about what filter rules were used, what was the result "
"of the evaluation of those rules, and which filter actions were applied to a "
"message."
msgstr ""
"Abra a xanela do visor do rexistro de filtrado; nel atópanse algunhas "
"opcións para controlar o rexistro do proceso de filtrado. No rexistro "
"atópase información valiosa sobre que regras de filtrado se usaron, cal foi "
"o resultado da avaliación desas regras e que accións de filtrado se "
"aplicaron a unha mensaxe."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1270
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Anti-Spam Wizard...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Asistente AntiCorreo-Lixo...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It starts a <link linkend=\"the-anti-spam-wizard\">wizard</link> which can "
"help you to set up spam filtering."
msgstr ""
"Inicia un <link linkend=\"the-anti-spam-wizard\">asistente</link> que pode "
"axudar a configurar o filtrado do correo lixo."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1283
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Anti-Spam Wizard...</guimenuitem>"
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Anti-Virus Wizard...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Asistente AntiCorreo-Lixo...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1289
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "It starts a <link linkend=\"the-anti-spam-wizard\">wizard</link> which "
#| "can help you to set up spam filtering."
msgid ""
"It starts a <link linkend=\"the-anti-virus-wizard\">wizard</link> which can "
"help you to set up scanning messages for viruses."
msgstr ""
"Inicia un <link linkend=\"the-anti-spam-wizard\">asistente</link> que pode "
"axudar a configurar o filtrado do correo lixo."

